  "referenceNumber": "RUS2432",
  "remarks": "\nNatalya Aleksandrovna TYURINA is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the following ground: TYURINA is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as a director (whether executive or non-executive), trustee, or equiva\nlent of Tsargrad Media LLC, an entity  carrying on business in \na sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely\n the Russian information, communications and digital technologies sector.\n  \n",
